  "description": "<p>This includes:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>Decide on relationship names (inverse/obverse)</li>\n\t<li>Updating classes to use ServiceMech/ServiceDef</li>\n\t<li>Updating references to such classes, etc..</li>\n\t<li>Updating demo objects</li>\n\t<li>Getting rid of \"fType\"<br/>\n  What is the \"fType\" when RELS-EXT is not present?<br/>\n  A: The default content model.  It should be indexed this way.<br/>\n  This will ultimately be a configurable thing by the repository; <br/>\n  however for 3.0b2 we can define exactly one.</li>\n</ul>\n",
